The O3DE lighting investigation's readout
=========================================

The rows of the point light demonstration's readout: SimplePointLightUtil at the inspected pixel, from what its
code computes there (src/o3de/lighting/script.rs `pointLight`). The title, the formula, and the other
demonstrations' rows are its code's (src/o3de/lighting/demos.rs `readout`).

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* o3de_lighting_values]
$[Import* o3de_lighting_natives]

$[# _light "#ffd98a"]

A number as the readout writes one: whole above 1000, two decimals above 10, four below.
$[# {_number v} {!if {>= {abs v} 1000.0}
    {fixed v 0}
    {!if {>= {abs v} 10.0} {fixed v 2} {fixed v 4}}}]

The bitwise and of two masks of eight bits.
$[# {_and a b} {fold
    {range 0 8}
    0
    {^ {acc k}
        [# bit {pow 2.0 {float k}}]
        [# set {^ {n} {= 1 {% {truncate {/ {float n} bit}} 2}}}]
        {!if {!and {set a} {set b}} {+ acc {round bit}} acc}}}]

$[# {_rows l}
    [# lit {!if {= 0 {_and {.lightChannels l} {.surfaceChannels l}}}
        {text {textKey "demos.skipped"}}
        {text {textKey "demos.lit"}}}]
    {'
        {row {text {textKey "common.distance_d"}} f"{${fixed {.distance l} 3} m}" textColor}
        {row {text {textKey "demos.attenuation_radius_r"}} f"{${fixed {.radius l} 3} m}" _light}
        {row "m_invAttenuationRadiusSquared" {_number {.invRadiusSquared l}} _light}
        {row "falloff = d² / r²" {_number {.falloff l}} _light}
        {row "(1 − falloff²)²" {_number {.radiusAttenuation l}} _light}
        {row "I / max(d², 1e-6)" {vectorText {.inverseSquare l} 3} textDimColor}
        {row {text {textKey "demos.lightintensity_lux"}} {vectorText {.intensity l} 3} _light}
        {row
            {text {textKey "demos.skipped_falloff_1"}}
            {!if {>= {.falloff l} 1.0} {text {textKey "demos.yes"}} {text {textKey "demos.no"}}}
            textColor}
        {row
            {text {textKey "demos.lighting_channels_light_surface"}}
            f"{0x${hex2 {.lightChannels l}} & 0x${hex2 {.surfaceChannels l}} → $lit}"
            _light}}]

The point light demonstration's rows, the first `readoutRows` of them.
$[# readout {: {^ {t} {!if {= {demo} "pointlight"}
    {take {_rows {pointLight}} {max 0 {round {readoutRows}}}}
    {'}}} Readout}]
